        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;—— Association (actor participates)&lt;br&gt;▷ Generalization (child inherits parent associations)&lt;br&gt;- - → &amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; (mandatory auth)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Roles from code:&lt;/b&gt; SystemAdmin, GeneralManager, FrontOfficeManager, HousekeepingManager, RevenueManager, MaintenanceManager, Accountant, Receptionist, Housekeeping, Maintenance.&lt;br&gt;Specialized actors inherit parent use cases (e.g. SystemAdmin inherits GM → FOM → Receptionist)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
